-- Text-only items state a result in prose, with no formal body.
TextDefinition: "A *monoid* is a magma with an identity element."
Documented:
. called: "monoid"
Id: "5543f2ef-6501-4362-ae0d-8425916f9ac3"


TextAxiom: "Every nonempty set of naturals has a least element."
Id: "61ac5cc0-b37b-48cb-b43d-8d9610d27dd5"


TextTheorem: "There are infinitely many primes."
References:
. $bourbaki.algebra
Id: "5bcd9782-411f-49de-be81-901aae86be4f"


TextConjecture: "Every even number above two is a sum of two primes."
Id: "51b55da2-a789-468f-9a2f-f67c8fb021a4"
